<title>USA: Iomega unveils two-gigabyte tape drive.</title>
<headline>Iomega unveils two-gigabyte tape drive.</headline>
<dateline>ROY, Utah 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iomega Corp said on Tuesday it has begun shipping a new two-gigabyte tape computer drive, called the Ditto 2GB.</p>
<p>The Ditto 2GB carries an estimated street price of $199.95 for an external drive and $149.95 for an internal drive.</p>
<p>Iomega also will sell tape cartridges to be used with the drives, it said.</p>
